{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"x":0.14849624038801074,"w":0.058270676930745446,"y":0.081395348871779349,"t":"Test 1","h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"x":0.48298852779877499,"w":0.12988760630289709,"t":"READING","c":1,"y":0.12751366127791286,"h":0.019681979668808358},{"y":0.19186046539753054,"h":0.016124080552336273,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","x":0.1484962355071992,"c":1,"w":0.30451128641764325},{"h":0.021202809566539638,"c":1,"x":0.14839320441256007,"w":0.77840235392252599,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","y":0.22989098447533318},{"x":0.14661654439397978,"h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.24999999971707421,"w":0.1616541290283203,"c":1,"t":"Passage 1 below."},{"c":1,"w":0.67481201171875005,"t":"Case Study: Tourism New Zealand website","x":0.20864662557450855,"h":0.024801959242271132,"y":0.29651162787304308},{"c":1,"y":0.348008219792588,"x":0.14646952590507414,"h":0.022651424272860265,"t":"New Zealand is a small country of four million inhabitants, a long-haul flight from all the","w":0.78032363891601564},{"c":1,"h":0.01950651464812303,"x":0.14467439181569602,"w":0.75577626546223953,"t":"major tourist-generating markets of the world. Tourism currently makes up 9% of the","y":0.3677763319865317},{"t":"country's gross domestic product, and is the country's largest export sector. Unlike other","x":0.14465038722127058,"w":0.79340972900390627,"y":0.38490838798833282,"h":0.021720248810030651,"c":1},{"y":0.40485823896641948,"x":0.14466837895161139,"c":1,"t":"export sectors, which make products and then sell them overseas, tourism brings its","w":0.75577000935872407,"h":0.020043009569471359},{"y":0.42222697673178766,"w":0.79717625935872405,"c":1,"h":0.02168669028199266,"x":0.14464540637917403,"t":"customers to New Zealand. The product is the country itself - the people, the places and"},{"c":1,"x":0.14285714900320556,"y":0.44172569245470172,"t":"the experiences. In 1999, Tourism New Zealand launched a campaign to communicate","w":0.78007517496744794,"h":0.019030121473520012},{"y":0.46072118472839318,"t":"a new brand position to the world. The campaign focused on New Zealand's scenic","x":0.14473685848636478,"h":0.017476488986632455,"w":0.7481202697753907,"c":1},{"y":0.47855109940258278,"w":0.74829757690429699,"x":0.14463677575037034,"h":0.022042163325676323,"t":"beauty, exhilarating outdoor activities and authentic Maori culture, and it made New","c":1},{"y":0.49647432348585041,"x":0.14275700008181549,"w":0.52279780069986981,"h":0.019560933650422774,"c":1,"t":"Zealand one of the strongest national brands in the world."},{"c":1,"t":"A key feature of the campaign was the website www.newzealand.com, which provided","x":0.14277399881749175,"y":0.54433140616244124,"h":0.020059152027137483,"w":0.77458257039388034},{"x":0.14279646797287293,"w":0.79336064656575533,"y":0.56304802424266243,"h":0.019495055204196254,"t":"potential visitors to New Zealand with a single gateway to everything the destination had","c":1},{"x":0.14085206635974393,"y":0.58027429092706628,"w":0.75964340209960934,"c":1,"t":"to offer. The heart of the website was a database of tourism services operators, both","h":0.021770737667046847},{"x":0.14090033960934675,"t":"those based in New Zealand and those based abroad which offered tourism services to","y":0.59950871197303357,"w":0.78774195353190113,"c":1,"h":0.018504096090755318},{"y":0.61832430770048097,"t":"the country. Any tourism-related business could be listed by filling in a simple form. This","x":0.14276941765042903,"w":0.7858685302734375,"h":0.020400449528052422,"c":1},{"y":0.63566240649439376,"t":"meant that even the smallest bed and breakfast address or specialist activity provider","w":0.76899897257486971,"c":1,"x":0.1427552714148512,"h":0.021031194860061775},{"h":0.021467340276537628,"t":"could gain a web presence with access to an audience of long-haul visitors. In addition,","c":1,"y":0.65445037141889217,"w":0.78592514038085937,"x":0.14276014616408247},{"t":"because participating businesses were able to update the details they gave on a","w":0.72205968221028649,"y":0.67258648145011934,"h":0.02130043437537732,"c":1,"x":0.14271544767675343},{"y":0.69317450074718445,"x":0.14097744878079746,"c":1,"t":"regular basis, the information provided remained accurate. And to maintain and improve","w":0.78947367350260422,"h":0.017707662588538287},{"h":0.019544826809698268,"y":0.71158357627101954,"w":0.79146184285481769,"c":1,"x":0.14092686592612458,"t":"standards, Tourism New Zealand organised a scheme whereby organisations appearing"},{"h":0.020830030373734876,"t":"on the website underwent an independent evaluation against a set of agreed national","y":0.72898589226089905,"w":0.76898315429687492,"x":0.14088200901564249,"c":1},{"x":0.14088580988486996,"w":0.78588399251302066,"t":"standards of quality. As part of this, the effect of each business on the environment was","h":0.021663671912336424,"c":1,"y":0.74753607901167174},{"y":0.76704572362758872,"w":0.10921278635660805,"h":0.016780645710686604,"c":1,"x":0.14088232860641584,"t":"considered."},{"c":1,"y":0.81320974448964334,"h":0.02067239470276161,"x":0.14089544398823156,"w":0.75204223632812495,"t":"To communicate the New Zealand experience, the site also carried features relating"},{"t":"to famous people and places. One of the most popular was an interview with former","w":0.75580032348632809,"h":0.019615351424551841,"c":1,"y":0.83183805290187829,"x":0.13901241579244791},{"t":"New Zealand All Blacks rugby captain Tana Umaga. Another feature that attracted a","y":0.85025540465730742,"w":0.75200927734375,"c":1,"h":0.019768371017072961,"x":0.14091085086722341},{"x":0.13902567349933453,"t":"lot of attention was an interactive journey through a number of the locations chosen","y":0.86904713200568307,"h":0.018863208817422428,"w":0.75201151529947907,"c":1},{"t":"for blockbuster films which had made use of New Zealand's stunning scenery as a","w":0.74083684285481755,"x":0.13897710323373655,"y":0.88647622242128143,"c":1,"h":0.019816960508563963},{"t":"backdrop. As the site developed, additional features were added to help independent","x":0.14097743680714775,"w":0.76315790812174478,"y":0.90695428204653916,"c":1,"h":0.017464322730639803},{"w":0.7559126281738282,"h":0.022142659596911751,"c":1,"y":0.92204826656358341,"x":0.13896122378307457,"t":"travellers devise their own customised itineraries. To make it easier to plan motoring"},{"w":0.77830479939778652,"h":0.020437472724791683,"c":1,"y":0.94321758920388177,"t":"holidays, the site catalogued the most popular driving routes in the country, highlighting","x":0.13904330320905559},{"y":0.96213831606830102,"h":0.018005214502023859,"x":0.13904126794796287,"w":0.65237299601236975,"c":1,"t":"different routes according to the season and indicating distances and times."},{"y":0.98691860451702695,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"x":0.13909774439240077,"w":0.026315789222717267,"t":"16"}]}